  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life changing opportunities through soccer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cazuca Futbol Club (CFC) is a high-performance soccer team born in the heart of Altos de Cazuca, one of the most vulnerable areas around Bogota. It provides young people with the opportunity to build their life projects through soccer and become professionals, so that they can stay away from risky environments such as illegality, gangs, and drug use. Currently, the CFC brings together more than 100 players who dream of reaching the big teams and having entire stadiums shout their names.</narrative>
  </description>
